# No secrets are required for the initial deployment or local development.
# Optional browser notifications: copy to .dev.vars, uncomment the lines below,
# and fill in a matching key pair from `npm run vapid:generate`.
# For production, add these as Worker secrets; see docs/deployment.md.
# Never commit real values.
# VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=
# VAPID_PRIVATE_JWK=
# VAPID_SUBJECT=mailto:admin@example.com

# Optional Access whitelist sync. Production token belongs in Worker Secrets.
# Limit the token to the intended account and Access: Apps and Policies editing.
# Never use production credentials for local automated tests.
# CF_ACCESS_API_TOKEN=
# ACCESS_SYNC_ACCOUNT_ID=
# ACCESS_SYNC_POLICY_ID=
